35,2,1,talk,Shion,,The wall is just plasterboard. I can hear everything. It is useless for privacy.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The invoices show we paid 68,000 yen for small groups. The quotes are high too.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,Three keyboards have crumbs. The tally shows two people use it constantly.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Servas,,The last hard talk happened in front of everyone. It was awful. We need a private space.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Eleven callouts last year. The room is falling apart. The tally confirms uneven use.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Servas, if we make it a quiet room, the noise stops.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, the callouts suggest the equipment is failing. A meeting space might be cheaper.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Daisuke, if we eat there, the crumbs stay. A kitchen is messy.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Shion, a quiet room helps, but we still need to talk. A meeting space?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, the meeting space quote is 141,000. The kitchen is 96,000.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
