47,2,3,talk,Rin,,I like the idea of a meeting space. We can book it and clean up after.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Servas,,A meeting space allows for difficult conversations without an audience. I agree.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The meeting space has fewer callouts expected if we maintain it properly.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shion,,I vote for the meeting space. It stops the noise leaking out.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I vote for the meeting space. The cost is justified by the privacy.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,I vote for the meeting space. It is fairer than the current system.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Servas,,I vote for the meeting space. It restores human connection.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I vote for the meeting space. It is the most sustainable option.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
